00:04:20.509 --> 00:04:22.249
She's right about that.

00:04:22.249 --> 00:04:23.249
That's it.

00:04:23.249 --> 00:04:25.270
She doesn't become a progressive hero.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:26.590
She is not on the left.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:30.370
We disagree about just about everything.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.030
And that's an important thing to remember.

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:37.199
When we look at these Maricopa's and we look
at these, I mean, not a term I use, but come

00:04:37.199 --> 00:04:45.370
to Jesus moments, do something now to deal
with the systemic fiasco that you was a part

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.870
of the Republican Party.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.069
This applies to State Senator Paul Boyer.

00:04:49.069 --> 00:04:50.069
It applies to Liz Cheney.

00:04:50.069 --> 00:04:51.569
It applies to all of them.

00:04:51.569 --> 00:04:54.419
Do something that deals with the systemic
issues.

00:04:54.419 --> 00:04:56.959
And then maybe I would find myself having
